# Tiếng Việt Skills

This repo contains three Vietnamese-learning agent skills in
`.agents/skills/*/SKILL.md`. When the user triggers one, read its SKILL.md and
follow it:

- `vn-polish` — user pastes a Vietnamese sentence → grammar check + native polish.
- `vn-tone-family` — user asks "/tone-family <word>" → show the syllable's tonal family.
- `vn-lyrics` — user pastes song lyrics/transcript → word breakdown + grammar + questions.

Shared rules (also in `AGENTS.md`): full diacritics always, English for
explanations, Vietnamese only in examples, prefer tables, flag unsure words
"Không chắc" after checking VDict / Wiktionary / SEAlang.